  "instance_name": "fashion_forward_mapping",
  "label": "The woman is mapped as 'fashion forward'",
  "description": "The text 'fashion forward!' is overlaid on the image of the woman, explicitly labeling her as embodying the concept of being trendy, innovative, and stylish. This creates an analogical mapping where the textual concept 'fashion forward' is projected onto the visual entity (the woman), affirming her style and confidence as fashionable and modern. The mapping is supported by her attire (hijab, Nike sweatshirt, leather jacket, studded gloves) and posture, which align with the cultural meaning of 'fashion forward' as a celebration of bold, contemporary self-expression.",
